          "The man stared at him. Then he let out a loud, incredulous bark of laughter, shoved Ma’un sideways with one casual cartoonish forearm, and breezed directly into the living room. “Move it, doofus! Out of the way!”",
          "“Hey!” Ma’un gasped, stumbling against the umbrella stand. “Excuse me, you can’t just—”",
