          "The man turned around, grinning with teeth that looked professionally whitened in the United Arab Emirates. Abdul—proprietor of a thriving hospitality firm and a five-star hotel in Dubai, and part-time patriarch of this humble household—crossed his arms.",
          "Instantly, Ma’un’s internal wiring slammed into emergency protocol. A red alert flashed across his conscience. S.O.N. Mode engaged.",
          "(S.O.N. Mode: Super Obedient Neutrality. The narrator notes that the author created this acronym, and while the author’s comedic choices remain legally questionable, the fear in Ma’un’s eyes is completely genuine.)",
          "Ma’un’s posture snapped into a rigid, ninety-degree military salute. His shoulders locked. His tone shifted into that of a junior candidate interviewing for a board seat at a multinational conglomerate.",
