          "At 10:45 AM, Ma’un knocked on his manager’s glass office door.",
          "Farooq looked up from his desk. “Yes, Ma’un? Did you finish the audit?”",
          "“Sir,” Ma’un said, standing straight. “I’m resigning.”",
          "Farooq dropped his pen. “What? Why? You’ve been here three weeks!”",
          "“Domestic responsibilities,” Ma’un answered honestly. “My wife needs me at home.”",
          "Farooq stared at him like he had grown two heads. “You’re twenty-one years old! Who retires at twenty-one for a wife?!”",
