          "“I'm working from my laptop upstairs,” Ma’un said calmly, walking to the kitchen for water. “I need flexible hours.”",
          "“He lost his mind,” Dania announced to the ceiling. “Marriage broke his brain.”",
          "Before Hana could start another lecture, someone swayed near the hallway.",
          "It was Naba.",
          "She was holding onto the doorframe with both hands, her knuckles white. Her face was flushed bright red, and her breath was fast and shallow.",
          "Hana noticed first. “Naba?”",
          "She walked over and touched Naba’s forehead. Hana gasped. “Mom! She’s burning up!”",
          "The teasing stopped instantly.",
          "Wardah was across the room in three strides, her hand pressed against Naba’s burning cheek. “Ya Allah, she has a high fever. Dania, get the thermometer! Hana, cold water and a towel! Ma’un, take her upstairs right now.”",
          "Ma’un took Naba by the arm. She was shivering so hard her teeth clicked. He helped her up the stairs step by step and eased her onto their bed.",
          "Within five minutes, the room became a hospital ward. Dania read the thermometer—102.5. Hana placed a cool, damp cloth over her eyes. Wardah sat on the edge of the mattress, feeding Naba hot soup with a spoon until the bowl was empty, then made her swallow two fever pills.",
          "Naba’s heavy eyelids fluttered shut, and she fell into a deep, exhausted sleep.",
